               // Write the engine evidence ledger CSV
//--- structure / OTE
   // HTF range (Daily -> H1, H4 -> M15 in the playbook)
  // Execution timeframe
    // HTF bars that define the dealing range
     // LTF bars that define the active leg (checked with the HTF)
   // OTE band lower bound
   // OTE band upper bound
                                          // [interpretation] the playbook names OTE but gives no
                                          // fib numbers; 62-79% is the standard OTE definition.
   // Require the entry to sit inside the OTE band
   // Longs only in discount, shorts only in premium
    // Entry window start (07:00 London)
   // Entry window end   (18:00 London)
     // Order-block search window (signal TF)
   // Displacement body ratio for the POI
   // How close price must come to the POI
      // Breaker fallback: bars from sweep to reclaim
 // Swept extreme must be a swing point (engine SigFractals)
   // Breaker fallback: limit at 50% of the body
